      "title": "[FULLY REMOTE] Senior Backend Go Engineer - Jobsity",
      "description": "## About [Jobsity](https://www.jobsity.com/)💡\nJobsity is a New York–based staffing company with 10+ years of experience, working with clients across the US, Canada, and Europe. We connect top-tier LATAM talent—only the top 3%—with long-term international opportunities and have successfully placed over 400 professionals across 15+ countries. As part of our recruitment process, we focus on finding the right role based on what matters most to you.\n\n## Requirements\n\n𝗪̳𝗵̳𝗮̳𝘁̳ ̳𝗱̳𝗼̳ ̳𝘆̳𝗼̳𝘂̳ ̳𝗻̳𝗲̳𝗲̳𝗱̳ ̳𝘁̳𝗼̳ ̳𝗮̳𝗽̳𝗽̳𝗹̳𝘆̳ ̳𝘀̳𝘂̳𝗰̳𝗰̳𝗲̳𝘀̳𝘀̳𝗳̳𝘂̳𝗹̳𝗹̳𝘆̳?🥇\n🌟 A minimum of +B2 level Conversational English level\n🌟 Must reside in Latin America🌎\n🌟 Availability to work Italian business hours (CET/CEST), with the workday starting at 9:00 AM CET and a daily stand-up at 9:30 AM CET ⏲️ \n🌟 5+ years of hands-on backend development with Go (Golang), building production services and APIs.\n🌟 3+ years of hands-on experience with Apache Kafka, including consumer groups, consumer lag, and safe schema evolution that doesn't break downstream consumers.\n🌟 Experience with event sourcing and event-driven architectures, applying DDD principles.\n\n## Modality\n👨‍💻 Fully remote\n\n## Perks that Jobsity offers!💎\n\n🔹Yearly paid vacation.\n🔹Paid local holidays.\n🔹Learning budget.\n🔹Financing program for home office supplies.\n🔹Bonuses for referrals and more!\n\n## Type of contract📜\n\nThis role is full-time!🕘\n...working remotely🏡, with USD payment💰, long-term relationship🤝, within an international team👩‍💻 👨‍💻, and working on international client projects!🌎\n\n## How to apply🤔\n✔️ Send an email to angela.barboza@jobsity.com with your CV and LinkedIn attached\n\n✔️ Or just send me a DM!\n\n## How to refer a friend🤔\n✔️ Refer a friend👥 sending an email with your friend's CV and LinkedIn attached\n✔️ Or just send me a DM!\n\n## Any questions or additional details needed?\nFeel free to send me a message on [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/angela-barboza/)💬",
